### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- OpenAI's official card (arXiv 2508.10925 / cdn.openai.com PDF) reports GPQA 80.1 (tools), HLE 14.9, MMLU 90.0, SWE-bench Verified 62.4 and Tau-Bench Retail 67.8 for **gpt-oss-120b**, and no "Lite" row.
- Search across Hugging Face, BenchLM, Vals AI, llm-stats and Artificial Analysis surfaced no `gpt-oss-120b-lite` model page, weights repo or evaluation; the folder's own metadata describes tuning but cites no measurements.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `.agents/rules.md`, zero verified numbers for the exact ID means self-exclusion; base-model figures are not silently merged (`RULES.md` lineage rule).
- Re-research trigger: a dated Lite model card or independent harness result → write a scored `DeepSeek_4.1_Flash.md` and retire this twin (`RULES.md` twin rule).

